行"],"cut":[true,true]},"hits":5,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/08/LCIDC01_1050801.pdf","printed_pages":"281-346"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/08/LCIDC01_1050801.pdf","printed_pages":"189-232"}]},{"person_id":"ly709","year":2016,"event_id":"speech:931066486da24386","activity":"speech","title":null,"meeting":null,"date":"2016-03-28","highlight":{"excerpt":"所以以這個商品來說，因為你本來就不是金融本業，本來專業法人是指懂得投資證券、投資金融工具這些知識，應該是金融的專業法人，但是現在的法人卻不是這樣。","terms":["金融","證券"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":4,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/17/LCIDC01_1051701.pdf","printed_pages":"199-356"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/17/LCIDC01_1051701.pdf","printed_pages":"199-356"}]},{"person_id":"ly709","year":2016,"event_id":"speech:a74305bf2d2758ec","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第1會期財政委員會第4次全體委員會議","meeting":"第9屆第1會期財政委員會第4次全體委員會議","date":"2016-03-16","highlight":{"excerpt":"我想這一點已經做了一定的呼籲，但是剛剛在核定的金融業務計畫裡，有一條寫著配合企業金融之資金需求及調度，發展人民幣衍生性金融商品，作為活絡市場及避險之工具。","terms":["金融"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":3,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/12/LCIDC01_1051201.pdf","printed_pages":"359-412"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/12/LCIDC01_1051201.pdf","printed_pages":"413-460"}]},{"person_id":"ly709","year":2016,"event_id":"speech:26279238d5ecd5ba","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第1會期第4次會議","meeting":"第9屆第1會期第4次會議","date":"2016-03-11","highlight":{"excerpt":"與內需有關的除了房地產以外就是觀光旅館了，發展觀光是臺灣的優勢，因為這個美麗之島不僅位於亞洲中心，更受到全世界所肯定，但對於觀光旅館的房屋單價加權也是一個國家三個標準。","terms":["觀光"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":3,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/04/LCIDC01_1050401.pdf","printed_pages":"149-159"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/04/LCIDC01_1050401.pdf","printed_pages":"149-159"}]}],"cross_strait":[{"person_id":"ly709","year":2016,"event_id":"bill:1050219070200100","activity":"bill_primary","title":"「兩岸協議監督條例草案」，請審議案。","meeting":"第9屆第1會期第2次會議","date":"2016-02-26","highlight":{"excerpt":"「兩岸協議監督條例草案」，請審議案。","terms":["兩岸"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":1,"links":[{"kind":"bill_page","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/bills/1050219070200100/details","printed_pages":null},{"kind":"bill_doc","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/download/agenda1/02/pdf/09/01/02/LCEWA01_090102_00007.pdf","printed_pages":null}]},{"person_id":"ly709","year":2016,"event_id":"speech:4e923966c1556eb1","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第1會期財政委員會第8次全體委員會議","meeting":"第9屆第1會期財政委員會第8次全體委員會議","date":"2016-04-06","highlight":{"excerpt":"下一張是「兩岸租稅協定配套修法兩岸人民關係條例，為何與陸配取得身分證綁在一起」，這個你剛才都有提到，這也是老生常談，你一直說這個是含兩岸租稅，兩岸租稅協議基本上都談好了嘛？","terms":["兩岸"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":4,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/21/LCIDC01_1052101.pdf","printed_pages":"259-308"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/21/LCIDC01_1052101.pdf","printed_pages":"259-308"}]},{"person_id":"ly709","year":2016,"event_id":"speech:b5e9bedf04f73a94","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第1會期財政、內政委員會第1次聯席會議","meeting":"第9屆第1會期財政、內政委員會第1次聯席會議","date":"2016-04-11","highlight":{"excerpt":"我要提出的是媒體關切的事情，今天下午即時新聞報導，剛才幾位委員也有提到，國人在肯亞並沒有犯罪紀錄卻被遣送到中國大陸，陸委會對此事處理的情況如何？","terms":["中國大陸","陸委會"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":2,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/23/LCIDC01_1052302.pdf","printed_pages":"73-150"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/23/LCIDC01_1052302.pdf","printed_pages":"73-150"}]}],"government":[{"person_id":"ly709","year":2016,"event_id":"speech:3a475f1cc2843601","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第1會期財政委員會第3次全體委員會議","meeting":"第9屆第1會期財政委員會第3次全體委員會議","date":"2016-03-14","highlight":{"excerpt":"因為監察院曾處理過，林審計長可以說是監察院審計部的尖兵，也是最資深的官員，就此部分，你的看法如何？","terms":["監察院","審計"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":4,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/09/LCIDC01_1050901.pdf","printed_pages":"267-334"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/09/LCIDC01_1050901.pdf","printed_pages":"267-334"}]},{"person_id":"ly709","year":2016,"event_id":"speech:b5e9bedf04f73a94","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第1會期財政、內政委員會第1次聯席會議","meeting":"第9屆第1會期財政、內政委員會第1次聯席會議","date":"2016-04-11","highlight":{"excerpt":"我多次在這裡肯定審計部，因為審計部作為政府的白血球，審計部在很多方面不斷的提醒行政機關在哪個部分有疏失，你們指出政府捐助的財團法人部分章程訂定解散後財產處置方式未盡周延，就這方面你們有盡了一些力量，但我認為各別處理的話速度太過緩慢，在設置的","terms":["審計"],"cut":[false,true]},"hits":3,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/23/LCIDC01_1052302.pdf","printed_pages":"73-150"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/23/LCIDC01_1052302.pdf","printed_pages":"73-150"}]},{"person_id":"ly709","year":2016,"event_id":"speech:77226ce253731f99","activity":"speech","title":null,"meeting":null,"date":"2016-03-21","highlight":{"excerpt":"我接續徐國勇委員所提的問題，其實這是老問題，但審計部在今天的報告中有特別提到，我希望王副審計長在此能將部門的意見再強調一下，有幾個單位連續幾年的執行率都低於40%？","terms":["審計"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":2,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/13/LCIDC01_1051301.pdf","printed_pages":"391-444"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/13/LCIDC01_1051301.pdf","printed_pages":"391-444"}]},{"person_id":"ly709","year":2016,"event_id":"speech:26279238d5ecd5ba","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第1會期第4次會議","meeting":"第9屆第1會期第4次會議","date":"2016-03-11","highlight":{"excerpt":"也許這件事情有些部分看起來不一定準確，比方說有部分基金會捐款是從其他的私立學校辦理，當然也可能因為統計的那一年不是選舉年，所以政黨的部分只有9,000萬元，候選人的部分僅有1,000萬元，一般來說不應該是如此，所以這部分並不是一個常態。","terms":["選舉","候選"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":2,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/04/LCIDC01_1050401.pdf","printed_pages":"149-159"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/04/LCIDC01_1050401.pdf","printed_pages":"149-159"}]},{"person_id":"ly709","year":2016,"event_id":"speech:9aac4c55abb38643","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第1會期司法及法制委員會第3次全體委員會議","meeting":"第9屆第1會期司法及法制委員會第3次全體委員會議","date":"2016-03-09","highlight":{"excerpt":"民主化受到國際稱讚的一項職務，然其相關的交接，竟然沒有法制化，事實上，與此有關的公務人員任用法第二十六條之一，該條文雖規定總統競選連任未當選或未再競選連任時，自次屆該項選舉當選人名單公告之日起至當選人宣誓就職止，各機關首長不得任用或遷調人員","terms":["公務人員","選舉"],"cut":[true,true]},"hits":2,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/07/LCIDC01_1050701.pdf","printed_pages":"1-80"}]}],"labor":[{"person_id":"ly709","year":2016,"event_id":"bill:1050219070200300","activity":"bill_primary","title":"「勞動基準法第三十六條及第三十九條條文修正草案」，請審議案。","meeting":"第9屆第1會期第2次會議","date":"2016-02-26","highlight":{"excerpt":"本院委員李應元等16人，為確實減少工時，真正全面實施周休二日，特擬具「勞動基準法第三十六條及第三十九條條文修正草案」。","terms":["工時","勞動","勞動基準法"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":3,"links":[{"kind":"bill_page","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/bills/1050219070200300/details","printed_pages":null},{"kind":"bill_doc","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/download/agenda1/02/pdf/09/01/02/LCEWA01_090102_00009.pdf","printed_pages":null}]},{"person_id":"ly709","year":2016,"event_id":"speech:713478aea6c309db","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第1會期財政委員會第7次全體委員會議","meeting":"第9屆第1會期財政委員會第7次全體委員會議","date":"2016-03-30","highlight":{"excerpt":"1951年通過「礦業與鋼鐵業勞工加入企業監理與管理委員會共同決定法」，而1976年通過的勞資共同決定法則擴大適用範圍，只要是有2,000名以上員工的大型企業都能適用，這樣的決定，德國的主流法學界都認為是違憲，所以德國雇主聯盟向憲法法院提起訴","terms":["勞工","勞資","雇主"],"cut":[false,true]},"hits":9,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/17/LCIDC01_1051701.pdf","printed_pages":"357-396"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/17/LCIDC01_1051701.pdf","printed_pages":"357-396"}]},{"person_id":"ly709","year":2016,"event_id":"speech:a74305bf2d2758ec","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第1會期財政委員會第4次全體委員會議","meeting":"第9屆第1會期財政委員會第4次全體委員會議","date":"2016-03-16","highlight":{"excerpt":"另外，勞動所得與資金所得占GDP的分配比越來越下降，對此，勞動部是否曾採取何種措施，以協助改善這種現象？","terms":["勞動","勞動部"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":3,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/12/LCIDC01_1051201.pdf","printed_pages":"359-412"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/105/12/LCIDC01_1051201.pdf","printed_pages":"413-460"}]}],"unclassified":[{"person_id":"ly709","year":2016,"event_id":"bill:1050310070203300","activity":"bill_primary","title":"「改善全國老舊建築物構造安全特別條例草案」，請審議案。","meeting":"第9屆第1會期第5次會議","date":"2016-03-18","highlight":null,"hits":0,"links":[{"kind":"bill_page","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/bills/1050310070203300/details","printed_pages":null},{"kind":"bill_doc","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/download/agenda1/02/pdf/09/01/05/LCEWA01_090105_00084.pdf","printed_pages":null}]},{"person_id":"ly709","year":2016,"event_id":"bill:1050303070200100","activity":"bill_primary","title":"「